{"id":"a6ccd6f7d977ed72","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-prikry.md","title":"Prikry Forcing","display":"df-prikry — Prikry Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prikry","aliases":["58-df-prikry"],"display":"df-prikry — Prikry Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-normal-measure]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prikry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prikry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prikry — Prikry Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-normal-measure\">58-df-zfc-normal-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (measurable cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (normal measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb{P}_U},\\leq^*_{\\mathbb{P}_U}\">\\(\\mathbb{P}_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb{P}_U},\\leq^*_{\\mathbb{P}_U}\\)</span> (Prikry forcing and its orders defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> (normal measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-normal-measure\">58-df-zfc-normal-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\)</span> (finite-sequence initial-segment predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment}\\vdash \\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\operatorname{ran}(t))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment}\\vdash \\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\operatorname{ran}(t))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\\mathbb P_U\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,A\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(i&lt;j\\to s(i)&lt;s(j))\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;(\\beta&lt;\\alpha)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\\mathbb P_U\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,A\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(i&lt;j\\to s(i)&lt;s(j))\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;(\\beta&lt;\\alpha)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\langle s,A\\rangle,\\langle t,B\\rangle\\in\\mathbb P_U\\land\\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\land B\\subseteq A\\land\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\langle s,A\\rangle,\\langle t,B\\rangle\\in\\mathbb P_U\\land\\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\land B\\subseteq A\\land\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}direct\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land t=s\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}direct\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land t=s\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Prikry forcing changes cofinalities without adding bounded subsets.</li>\n<li>It has the Prikry property and adds no bounded subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The initial-segment predicate now asserts finite-sequence function typing before applying domain, range, and restriction operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-normal-measure","status":"resolved","id":"2e059389c097fae1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-normal-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-normal-measure","status":"resolved","id":"2e059389c097fae1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)$ (normal measure predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-normal-measure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{P}_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb{P}_U},\\leq^*_{\\mathbb{P}_U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment}\\vdash \\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\operatorname{ran}(t))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\\mathbb P_U\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,A\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(i<j\\to s(i)<s(j))\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in A\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;(\\beta<\\alpha)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\langle s,A\\rangle,\\langle t,B\\rangle\\in\\mathbb P_U\\land\\operatorname{InitialSegment}_S(s,t)\\land B\\subseteq A\\land\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}direct\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq^*_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land t=s","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2259,"backlinks":[{"id":"86cbba3fb482d831","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\kappa,U\\in V$ and $\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)$ is the exact predicate from [[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]"},{"id":"8939a496badbb7a7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\kappa,U\\in V$ and $\\operatorname{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)$ is the exact predicate used by [[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]."},{"id":"62fc4eb5c29a689d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1